  "$recognised": "Whether the far end is a bouncer, which decides whether two devices may both be on it. The soju and ZNC rows are what those two actually answered CAP LS with, read off the wire on 2026-09-15.",
  "$bind": "What goes before CAP END to land on one of a bouncer's networks. The desktop has sent this since bouncer support landed and the phone never did, so a bound network row opened on whichever network the bouncer picked.",
